# NormalizedModel v2

Source: `docs/normalized-model.md`.

- Single type everywhere; optional properties mirror the source (lossless round trip). Write manifest rows through `canonicalModel`.
- Use `fieldTypeToken.ts` for kind / filter token mapping; no ad-hoc string maps.
- The parser must keep enum, literal default, `select: false` (→ `access.hidden`), unmodelled options, TS type, `?`, JSDoc, timestamps, `mongoose.model` name and `collection`. Model files are regenerated every run; losing any of these is a regression.
- BE generate and model save share `buildMongooseModelContext`.
- Gates after a change here: smoke, `--manifest`, `--p5`, `--resave-models` + `--compare` (`docs/verification.md`).
